{"version":2,"sourceHash":"1822d08b1cf0edd0475c92c0afa22fe040cec6e8e632f2e40817de52b7dfdd2e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-27","no":"EP.27","tag":"第27话 · 刚出炉的早晨","title":"刚出炉的早晨","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-1","s":"n","t":"渡船行至河心，她又摊开手掌。夜风穿过五指，可仍不像自己的手。","bg":"river","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"neutral"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"bgm":"riverReturn","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-2","s":"yeon","t":"你也歇一会儿吧。从刚才起就一直用受伤的爪子撑着。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-3","s":"n","t":"猫挪位置时踉跄，她本能托住小前爪，腕上的庚字便暖了。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-4","s":"neo","t":"等一下，别松手。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-5","s":"n","t":"白毛尖泛光，包住小小身体。帽下额头的四纹依次亮起，沉向手腕。她掌中小前爪，自粉红肉垫起缓缓伸长。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-6","s":"sys","t":"［ 庚 · 连接修复／外形恢复 ］"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-7","s":"n","t":"光散后，银发男人坐在船底。小深蓝披风延成长绣金银外套，她握住的已是人的手。","neoForm":"human","r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"fx":"reveal","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"reveal","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-8","s":"yeon","t":"……Yeongnyangi？"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-9","s":"neo","t":"是我。这模样时，叫你起的名字，Neo。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-10","s":"n","t":"他屈伸陌生的手指，左手背的锈痕，在人皮肤上也一样蔓延。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-11","s":"yeon","t":"你的手好暖。还和刚才一样疼吗？"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-12","s":"neo","t":"一点。变成人，也不是全好了。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-13","s":"n","t":"她让出位置，他曲起陌生的膝盖坐下。两人肩膀第一次在相同高度碰到。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-14","s":"yeon","t":"那就慢慢习惯吧。我不也是刚变回来吗。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-15","s":"neo","t":"嗯，今天借一下你的肩。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-16","s":"n","t":"摩卡迟迟醒来，来回看两人，揉两次眼，捋一下胡须。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-17","s":"moka","t":"猫也是人？猪也是人，这船上只剩我一个兽了吗。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-boat-1","s":"n","t":"嘴上抱怨，摩卡还是把毯子搭上Neo肩。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-boat-2","s":"moka","t":"吃过再解释。你俩都抖着呢。"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-return-18","s":"n","t":"她笑，Neo也微笑。脸陌生，困窘时避开视线的习惯却没变，她这才松了握手的力道。"},{"id":"ep-27:1","s":"n","t":"船沿河走了一夜。天将亮，卖时间之岛的熟悉码头出现，巷尾飘来烤面包香。","bg":"jae","bgm":"orientalGirl","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:2","s":"ln","t":"姐姐快出来，客人来了！不，不是客人——","x":"greet","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":{"who":"ln","x":"greet"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27:3","s":"yeon","t":"露娜！","x":"happy"},{"id":"ep-27:4","s":"ln","t":"咦，声音是猪姐姐，脸却是人？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:5","s":"yeon","t":"就是小猪姐姐。现在是人类姐姐了。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:6","s":"ln","t":"哇，真是人！有手指，能拿面包了吧！","x":"cheer"},{"id":"ep-27:7","s":"n","t":"露娜拉着她的手上下晃，新奇地逐根摸手指。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-1","s":"n","t":"目光随后停在她身后的银发男人，银外套衣角粘着一根白毛。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-2","s":"ln","t":"等等，猫哥哥呢？难道猫也是人？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-3","s":"moka","t":"我在船上也问过，一模一样。没人答我。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-4","s":"neo","t":"也是猫。只是现在不是。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-5","s":"ln","t":"那尾巴去哪儿了？胡子呢？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-6","s":"n","t":"露娜掀外套衣角找尾巴。Neo僵着看她，她忍笑转过头。"},{"id":"ep-27:cat-7","s":"yeon","t":"他说这模样叫Neo。尾巴我也没找到。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:8","s":"lns","t":"露娜，先把手上的面团弄完再玩。啊，是客人们。","x":"knead","c":{"who":"lns","x":"knead"}},{"id":"ep-27:9","s":"n","t":"露娜姐姐围裙沾粉走来，逐个打量，笑得像叹气。"},{"id":"ep-27:10","s":"lns","t":"连Neo先生也变成人了。惊讶留到以后，先看胳膊和尾巴。","x":"sigh"},{"id":"ep-27:neo-nickname","s":"lns","t":"不过叫顺嘴了，还叫猫先生可以吧？"},{"id":"ep-27:11","s":"moka","t":"尾巴本来就这样！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:12","s":"lns","t":"都进来，洗手、坐下、吃饭，按顺序。","x":"orders"},{"id":"ep-27:13","s":"n","t":"店里暖和，刚出炉面包蒸汽盈架，壁钟也恢复了自己的速度。","bg":"jae","bgm":"teaKind","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:14","s":"lns","t":"今天第一炉。不收钱，但要吃完。","x":"bread","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"bliss"},"c":{"who":"lns","x":"bread"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"}},{"id":"ep-27:15","s":"yeon","t":"味道全在，是有滋味的香气。","x":"bliss"},{"id":"ep-27:16","s":"moka","t":"这下能用手吃了。烫，慢慢吃。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:17","s":"yeon","t":"我知道。可是太香了，实在等不及。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-27:luck-1","s":"n","t":"露娜递她一块抹黄油的面包，面包从指尖滑下，黄油面朝地。"},{"id":"ep-27:luck-2","s":"ln","t":"咦？再来，我再拿！","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:luck-3","s":"n","t":"第二、第三块也同一面落地。摩卡拿的、Neo拿的，却都好好的。"},{"id":"ep-27:luck-4","s":"yun","t":"运气见底，就会在这种地方露出来。下块请连盘子一起接。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-27:18","s":"n","t":"姐姐连盘放到她面前。她咬一口，就停住。面包温热，黄油的甜在舌尖慢慢化开。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:19","s":"yeon","t":"真好吃。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:20","s":"neo","t":"哭了？太烫吗。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:21","s":"yeon","t":"不知道。账本收走了运气，好像把滋味留给我了。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:22","s":"n","t":"姐姐无声再放一块。她边吃边哭，谁也没笑。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:23","s":"lns","t":"运气拿得走，胃口可拿不走。那是长在身上的。","x":"blanket"},{"id":"ep-27:24","s":"n","t":"姐姐说完回炉前，背比以前弯了些，是卖掉的时间尚未全还回来的背。"},{"id":"ep-27:25","s":"yun","t":"姐姐，您的出生年月日时？这面包，食神一定很好。","x":"sly","c":{"who":"yun","x":"sly"}},{"id":"ep-27:26","s":"lns","t":"算命先生，吃面包的时候把嘴闭上。这是本店的规矩。","x":"orders"},{"id":"ep-27:27","s":"yun","t":"好的。我喜欢规矩。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:28","s":"neo","t":"这规矩我喜欢。","x":"smirk"},{"id":"ep-27:29","s":"n","t":"吃饱的人陆续离座，她拿面包袋坐后门台阶。Neo坐旁边拉下左袖，仍遮不全手背锈痕。","bg":"jae","tone":"dark","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"soft"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:30","s":"yeon","t":"别遮了。我都看过了。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:31","s":"n","t":"Neo迟疑了一下，卷起袖子。锈色停在肩膀下方。外形变了，伤却没有消失。"},{"id":"ep-27:32","s":"yeon","t":"我说让你走开，收回了。我就是为了说这句话才去河边的。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:33","s":"neo","t":"我知道。我听见了。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-27:34","s":"yeon","t":"听见了？在哪里？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:35","s":"neo","t":"河下游。你的声音，比水声更大。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:36","s":"yeon","t":"这种事干嘛记得。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-27:37","s":"neo","t":"我也答应你。疼就说，不瞒。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:38","s":"yeon","t":"说好了。客服违约可是要扣星的。","x":"serious","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:39","s":"neo","t":"好。你也别灭火，等水化开，我们一起撑。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-27:40","s":"n","t":"她掰面包送他嘴边，他没有推辞。两人默默嚼了许久。"},{"id":"ep-27:petal-1","s":"n","t":"Neo看着她发间花夹。头顶的花在人形时留下这小发夹，五片中一片仍白得像纸。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:petal-2","s":"yeon","t":"这片好像回不来了。没事，夹子还是漂亮的。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:41","s":"n","t":"回到店里时，露娜已经抱着下一炉的面团跑来跑去。","bg":"jae","bgm":"teaKind","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":{"who":"lns","x":"knead"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:ember-1","s":"n","t":"炉旁摩卡正把火种夹进小陶罐，每夹一下，须尖便熏黑一点。","c":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-27:ember-2","s":"yeon","t":"什么罐？烤面包用的？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-27:ember-3","s":"moka","t":"火种罐。祭典岛的炉子全灭了，从这里借点火带回去。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:ember-4","s":"lns","t":"盖好能撑三天，路上别打开看。","x":"orders"},{"id":"ep-27:ember-5","s":"n","t":"摩卡把罐抱在怀里，按了两次盖，神情与聊烤串时不同。"},{"id":"ep-27:42","s":"n","t":"太阳又高些，她端面包盘到窗旁。安静巷子的墙上，几只闻香来的猫打盹。","bg":"jae","shot":"wide","im":true,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:43","s":"n","t":"对街檐影下，坐着一个黑影。破披风间，右前爪的黑环清晰可见。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":null,"r":null},{"id":"ep-27:44","s":"yeon","t":"（老虎。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-27:45","s":"n","t":"老虎没有看面包店。是在装作没看。只有鼻尖，微微朝面包香气的方向偏了一点。"},{"id":"ep-27:46","s":"n","t":"她想开窗，手又停住。她一出去，老虎就会走。这点她似乎明白。"},{"id":"ep-27:47","s":"lns","t":"在看什么呢？","x":"bread","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"lns","x":"bread"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27:48","s":"yeon","t":"啊，没有。只是外面有人。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:49","s":"n","t":"露娜的姐姐朝窗外瞥了一眼。随后一声不吭，用纸包好一个刚出炉的面包，拿着出了门。"},{"id":"ep-27:50","s":"n","t":"巷里比店里凉。姐姐走近檐下，老虎起身，披风滴水。","bg":"jae","tone":"desat","bgm":"lakeDawn","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"lns","x":"bread"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"tiger","x":"surprise"},"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:51","s":"tiger","t":"我只是路过。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:52","s":"lns","t":"是啊。路过的时候肚子饿了，对吧。","x":"bread"},{"id":"ep-27:53","s":"n","t":"姐姐递面包。老虎先看面包，再看她的脸，像在算买什么、多少钱、何时还。"},{"id":"ep-27:54","s":"tiger","t":"这个多少钱呢。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-27:55","s":"lns","t":"免费的。","x":"tired"},{"id":"ep-27:56","s":"tiger","t":"没有免费的东西。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:57","s":"lns","t":"有啊。现在这里就有一个。","x":"sigh"},{"id":"ep-27:58","s":"n","t":"老虎不伸手，姐姐也不等，直接掰开它前爪放上面包，再合拢免得掉。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:59","s":"lns","t":"趁热吃。凉了就只是面包了。","x":"blanket"},{"id":"ep-27:60","s":"n","t":"露娜的姐姐转身走回店里，一次也没回头。"},{"id":"ep-27:61","s":"n","t":"它站了很久，爪中面包温暖，黑环安静得仿佛忘了收紧。","im":true,"fx":"heart","sfx":"chime","l":null,"c":{"who":"tiger","x":"water"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"heart","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:62","s":"tiger","t":"竟然免费吗。","x":"water"},{"id":"ep-27:63","s":"n","t":"它没吃，小心把面包放进破披风，挨着藏鼓手孩子名字的地方，消失在影中。"},{"id":"ep-27:64","s":"n","t":"回到店里的露娜姐姐，又开始揉面，像什么事也没发生过。","bg":"jae","bgm":"teaKind","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"soft"},"c":{"who":"lns","x":"knead"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:65","s":"yeon","t":"姐姐，谢谢您。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27:66","s":"lns","t":"谢什么。面包店就是给人面包的地方。","x":"knead"},{"id":"ep-27:67","s":"n","t":"她没再说。窗外檐下空了，湿痕直到日斜也没干。"},{"id":"ep-27:68","s":"n","t":"傍晚，通仓库的旧门缝漏光。原以为炉光，金光却如线从每条门缝漫出。","bgm":"fortuneReveal","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"sfx":"sparkle","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:69","s":"ln","t":"姐姐，仓库门亮了！又是时间小偷？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:70","s":"lns","t":"那扇门本来打不开啊。","x":"sigh"},{"id":"ep-27:71","s":"n","t":"旧门木纹化成牌画，边缘刻星，中间画开门，下方浮出的不是数字，是字母。","im":true,"fx":"tarot","sfx":"chime","shot":"wide","bg":"tarotDoor","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"tarot","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:72","s":"sys","t":"［ THE DOOR · 命运代码8/8确认 · 可归返 · 同行限制 ］"},{"id":"ep-27:door-1","s":"sys","t":"［ 开启 · 次日破晓／同行 · 借用一格者 ］"},{"id":"ep-27:73","s":"yeon","t":"认识，最初应用里那张牌。按了它，我才来这里。","x":"surprise","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-27:74","s":"neo","t":"归返的门。只让八字齐全的人，以及借用那人一格的人通过。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:75","s":"yeon","t":"那我能走，能回家？","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-27:76","s":"neo","t":"由你选。门明早开，落在哪里，由门定。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-27:77","s":"n","t":"她向门迈一步，又停下回头：摩卡、闰月、露娜、姐姐，还有Neo。"},{"id":"ep-27:78","s":"yeon","t":"大家一起走，对吧？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:79","s":"n","t":"没人立即回答。闰月把戴手套的手贴向门，金线在手前骤断。","bgm":"gloom","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:80","s":"sys","t":"[ 年 □□ · 月 □□ · 日 □□ · 时 ■■ · 7/8 · 无法通过 ]","im":true,"fx":"veil","sfx":"glitch","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:81","s":"yun","t":"果然我不行，没有时辰。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27:82","s":"yeon","t":"时辰？被青兔吃掉的那个？","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-27:83","s":"yun","t":"缺了八字之一，在这门眼里就还没完整。真伤心。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:84","s":"yeon","t":"那就找啊。一起找到，再一起走。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:85","s":"yun","t":"小姐竟然愿意等我。这就是我们八字相合的证据呢。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-27:86","s":"neo","t":"不是。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:87","s":"n","t":"闰月笑了。那个笑，过了很久才结束。"},{"id":"ep-27:88","s":"moka","t":"我也不走。","x":"base","c":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-27:89","s":"yeon","t":"摩卡？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:90","s":"moka","t":"我本就是这边的水獭。得带火种回祭典岛，守住火。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:moka-stay-1","s":"moka","t":"再说把烤串的水獭带去人间，立刻上新闻。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:91","s":"yeon","t":"可是……","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:92","s":"moka","t":"可是什么可是。听我说唱的人少一个，舍不得的就这件事。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27:93","s":"moka","t":"别哭了，人类。比当猪的时候还难看。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-27:94","s":"n","t":"嘴上这样说，它夹着火罐，额头撞了一下她手背，像当日分给她气息时。","fx":"fire","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"fire","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:95","s":"yeon","t":"那Neo呢？","x":"cry","c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-27:96","s":"neo","t":"我去。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:97","s":"yeon","t":"为什么？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27:98","s":"neo","t":"我是借来的格子，格子走，我得跟着。客服也出差。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-27:99","s":"yeon","t":"上门服务值几颗星？","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:100","s":"neo","t":"五颗。河上你这样说过。","x":"smirk"},{"id":"ep-27:101","s":"yeon","t":"连这也都听见了。","x":"shock"},{"id":"ep-27:choice-1","s":"n","t":"门的金光低下来，似在等答复。走，便要和众人分别；留，房间里留下的那天就会一直停着。","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:choice-2","s":"yeon","t":"我走。但今晚要在这里睡。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:choice-3","s":"lns","t":"那先拿被子吧。明早面包早点烤。","x":"blanket"},{"id":"ep-27:choice-4","s":"n","t":"那夜店里灯亮到很晚。她把借来的被子拉至下巴，久久看仓库门漏出的金光。"},{"id":"ep-27:102","s":"n","t":"次晨，她与Neo站在仓库门前。露娜塞来面包袋，姐姐只在炉前挥手。","bg":"tarotDoor","bgm":"riverReturn","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:103","s":"ln","t":"姐姐，再来。人姐姐、猪姐姐都好，一定再来。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:104","s":"yeon","t":"一定。下回我付钱买面包。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-27:105","s":"lns","t":"没我们家的好吃，可不收哦。","x":"tired"},{"id":"ep-27:106","s":"yun","t":"到了那边，这里也许会像梦般模糊。不过别太担心。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27:107","s":"yeon","t":"不会模糊的。这么好吃的面包，怎么忘得了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27:108","s":"yun","t":"是啊。面包是忘不了的。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27:109","s":"n","t":"他把戴手套的手放进口袋，没说姐姐今早又问了他的名字。"},{"id":"ep-27:110","s":"n","t":"她握门柄，温度像刚出炉的面包。门开，金色晨风涌进来。","im":true,"fx":"stars","sfx":"door","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"stars","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27:111","s":"n","t":"跨门槛时，她似听见身后闰月极轻地念了另一个名字。不是闰月，声音却被风盖过。"},{"id":"ep-27:112","s":"n","t":"门关上了。留在面包店的人们望了那扇门许久。它又变回了一扇旧仓库门。","bg":"tarotDoor","tone":"desat","shot":"quiet","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27:113","s":"n","t":"无人看见的地方，几滴雨渗进关上的门缝，朝那一边，像追着谁。","sfx":"rain"}]}
